<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the final day of</p>
<p>four-day Red Stripe Cup cricket matches on Monday:</p>
<p>In San Fernando, Trinidad: Jamaica 349 and 201-5 declared</p>
<p>(J.Adams 67, I.Garrick 64); Trinidad and Tobago 256 (B.Lara 135)</p>
<p>and 118-5 (S.Ragoonath 54 not out). Match drawn</p>
<p>In Georgetown: Guyana v Windward Islands. Match abandoned -</p>
<p>rain.</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under played, won, lost, drawn, no</p>
<p>decision, points):</p>
<p> Barbados	     4   3   1   0   0   48</p>
<p> Jamaica		4   1   0   2   1   36</p>
<p> Leeward Islands    4   1   0   1   2   28</p>
<p> Trinidad &amp; Tobago  4   1   1   1   1   24</p>
<p> Windward Islands   4   0   3   0   1   14</p>
<p> Guyana		 4   0   1   0   3   12</p>
<p>(Note: Windwards earned 10 points for two games which they</p>
<p>led on first innings but lost).</p>
</text>
